{
  "key": 42051,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_SovereignPleaseHelpFindMyItem",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah! I’m very sorry!\r",
        "I’m so scared...\r",
        "I had my KADABRA send out a distress\n",
        "signal, but I didn’t think anybody\f",
        "would respond...\r",
        "I’m Mira...\r",
        "I was catching Pokémon, and then\n",
        "I dropped something really valuable\f",
        "to me, and then I got lost...\r",
        "Please! Can you help me find my\n",
        "lost item?\r",
        "Mira thinks she dropped it really far\n",
        "inside this cave!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_PlayerDecidedToGoWithMira",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} decided to go with\n",
        "Mira!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_IllKeepYourPokemonHealthy",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: I’ll keep your Pokémon healthy\n",
        "all the time!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_ILikeYourName",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer, your name is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r",
        "My name is Mira.\n",
        "I like your name!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_OhPlayerIWaitedALongTime",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\n",
        "I waited... A long time...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_SovereignTheresTheExit",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Oh! There’s the exit!\r",
        "I want to get tougher so I\n",
        "won’t be such a scaredy-cat.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, Mira has a great gift for\n",
        "you, for all of your help!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_Dummy6",
      "garbage": 29
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_Dummy7",
      "garbage": 29
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_Dummy8",
      "garbage": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_ILikeHelpfulMoves",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: I like helpful Pokémon moves\n",
        "like Growl and Minimize.\r",
        "Those kinds of moves are my\n",
        "favorites."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_EasyToGetConfused",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: This cave...\n",
        "It’s so easy to get confused.\r",
        "Do you know where we are?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_MiraWillTryLikeYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, did you get to be\n",
        "so good because you’re always with\f",
        "your Pokémon?\r",
        "Yes! That has to be it!\n",
        "Mira will try like you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_SovereignGabiteCry",
      "en_US": [
        "Keeeeeul!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_SovereignStayAwayFromMira",
      "en_US": [
        "Eek!\r",
        "Stay away from Mira!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_SovereignAreYouLeaving",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Oh... Are you leaving?\n",
        "I haven’t found my item yet...\r",
        "I’ll keep searching until you\n",
        "return here, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Please don’t be long!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_SovereignYouCameBack",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Yay! I’m so happy that\n",
        "you came back, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Let’s keep searching! Mira is sure\n",
        "we’ll find her item soon...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_SovereignFoundCrimsonRibbon",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} found\n",
        "a Crimson Ribbon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_SovereignThatsMyRibbon",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! That’s it! That’s\n",
        "Mira’s special ribbon that she lost!\r",
        "Thank you! Now, let’s get out of\n",
        "this scary cave!\r",
        "You know where the exit is, right?\n",
        "It’s the same way you came in!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_SovereignTM85IsDazzlingGleam",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: That TM contains Dazzling Gleam!\n",
        "It’s a rare Fairy-type move that\f",
        "a lot of Pokémon can use!\r",
        "Okay! Bye-bye! See you again some\n",
        "other time!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "WaywardCave1F_Text_SovereignThankYouLetsGetOut",
      "en_US": [
        "Mira: Thank you!\r",
        "Now, let’s get out of this scary cave!\r",
        "You know where the exit is, right?\n",
        "It’s the same way you came in!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
